      "en": "It shall be, when he lies down, that you shall note the place where he is lying. Then you shall go in, uncover his feet, and lie down. Then he will tell you what to do.”",
      "ko": "그가 누울 때에 너는 그 눕는 곳을 알았다가 들어 가서 그 발치 이불을 들고 거기 누우라 그가 너의 할일을 네게 고하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "dce0ca3bf9b8e4da8a70daff4b6b5245159ccd2912fb681b67ef4956b5e6a8bb",
      "translation_text_hash": "7c886cbb1f77472cbdfaea8e6e64645ba4faf66d74fed5bd678c41d20ead8e9b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
