      "en": "She said to her, “All that you say, I will do.”",
      "ko": "룻이 시모에게 이르되 어머니의 말씀대로 내가 다 행하리이다 하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "1c4bc7270bf544584626346abf08e8402e99dbdb21f5dee1427eec84ec8571d8",
      "translation_text_hash": "6dd41fcee74a80fe782d1022d52b2331c8ddf58d8e48892f89b4fa44b4a33da9",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
