      ],
      "en": "She went down to the threshing floor, and did everything that her mother-in-law told her.",
      "ko": "그가 타작 마당으로 내려가서 시모의 명대로 다 하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "3e06bf345b6fa8a487e6cfe62f7afcd85ee0657b195d69b7af861edbdb9d1b2b",
      "translation_text_hash": "3a65484a4ac860fc44b69b706928e9394932c8e0532292eba6054e7d6a7dcc8d",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
